{"id": "ds:303:322:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]OK Rascal, you’re up! What do you got for us?", "sourceSha256": "ecd2cb72baa4f2f12afe6f42c45a8d195da45a1dafb882af515b18f1be2a4b76", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "45e1aaba52e3bad47237949a888dc2533cb412d691e6c0f6a8b09c00db24a03b"}
{"id": "ds:303:323:Dialogue Text", "source": "Ok! Here goes!", "sourceSha256": "6955e7985337c27bf1b3895627b84d38b82a89b77b38e504750db2268ba2423a", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "6c5779f4eaa44fba73eda7975a80448acfe534a1eb7183f9f8d9250fb896b429"}
{"id": "ds:303:325:Dialogue Text", "source": "We molded the Earth", "sourceSha256": "4cfda961aa21c85ecda38ac13d7b241ee2079a92ab6a7606df2e7559dc3abc75", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "0c5cb07a690667fda2551313ff77f26471a0820c6cf080782c21da211ebda7c1"}
{"id": "ds:303:326:Dialogue Text", "source": "Across the raging waters", "sourceSha256": "d0283d3285ca1d9d8f04f99cb3100ca5a01dff6f72364f81e6a1af2e62783832", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "025b5d5f1f00eb42b99e291c8821e80d0564e4b8121fd506d18865e0d57e4ad1"}
{"id": "ds:303:327:Dialogue Text", "source": "To unite our friends", "sourceSha256": "1e88cd471eda141a400327ba4506609d25f3c8a0f295d06f9ac75bee758cc175", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "502c809652777a4d015eaf9a025ffe875b34f0e17d26ae8ea55821d0caf9c73b"}
{"id": "ds:303:330:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]I would change it to. \"How lucky are we\"", "sourceSha256": "c31ca101188894b7be8c5712d0e56b902826d77a25f8496e62b68ec3dbf224a5", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ad46fd1c6a2f2d4d08619113260741d5026a206c9c7c145e5e75a8f607635d29"}
{"id": "ds:303:332:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Oh! Heh, aww!", "sourceSha256": "37c75b5067ba31b44a677dfe58b0798f18713eee147232897295470228293fd5", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "36d144eee840b00e3b87c902daace7b5098e417794c88ec819df4c944a624306"}
{"id": "ds:303:334:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]It’s very good Oliver, the feeling is quite mutual!", "sourceSha256": "835cf60557f9b46c62c004d21154a91b57002db54f71afac1f39ba1fbd051364", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "0bfb48fc59c173bf916b676d01f896d672ed069b9d5ffb5adff6ceb2d9407aee"}
{"id": "ds:303:335:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Aww I love that!", "sourceSha256": "1ec1b90c0b882907f6c3b6d1a282090ba9fe7169c493cba21f5f41e1504884e4", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "256990c8603c47120077d4cbbf1501b4ca2877f6ab296feb162ac0727cd13932"}
{"id": "ds:303:336:Dialogue Text", "source": "Yeah man that’s great!", "sourceSha256": "788e1c719f4232c0dae8d9cdbb8829026bac773da32b309090f979d6ed2d3830", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "8a263edb6cda233797625059c2b63d6f28d694630fa50ea39a393cf2c59544b2"}
{"id": "ds:303:338:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]I do have one note, however.", "sourceSha256": "c1a5abed784ac09ec20fbc173fce75946e73d4920d2c543ce5dd74fcd5dba6d1", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "cd20614b927564db512d36268b9d216036cc8afc9f379c9d4202910af4f741ef"}
{"id": "ds:303:340:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]O-oh?", "sourceSha256": "df9a098b5649ee93daff3c184443d79d8abf6bf8f1e5071e2d41d21d45b163df", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ed5d8c04eb2e13813044ab475dcfd4a992fe545f4812749a30c4cecdced3a69a"}
{"id": "ds:303:342:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Yeah it’s that last line.", "sourceSha256": "93d820ef24f10dac271a3d82c155272358379867773047688bf7dd3177940656", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "5b6d1c7719acc975d54ec9764e083627ca1eccdfc977d46575beac5ee652af4b"}
{"id": "ds:303:343:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Good Drink and Good Friends\nOn a lazy afternoon\nHow lucky am I", "sourceSha256": "c7bd750d581776c34d807c6750ad6155e27ecfdc6ea2d1912299ee93e5cfa29c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c4c8669fb9d57f43c491a2eb50210136608775722ae628698ca31a8d04470853"}
{"id": "ds:303:345:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]Heh, thanks guys.", "sourceSha256": "25cea83101f0b0380e3dbe38d118653d3a821176ee62712461eb85e65af56fd1", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "15211aa5a5f03394438bdc323104a6a7f2410e6c581ae3b472baff77a7a22e54"}
{"id": "ds:303:346:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Oliver, would you like to go next? I can tell you came up with something.", "sourceSha256": "433b83a688a6a5501b0dd9c06cc9d730c0d5731cebab75ee953265d6ff9f62e4", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "edc7a1e42fa9049030480ca312540d6a14cd1393be46493b973340124d7de544"}
{"id": "ds:303:348:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Oh gosh… Ok… Yeah.", "sourceSha256": "8b3229f29037353a6aa3b9f4e99466b0c9cc9b87035a1e076df00f75ed65dfe4", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c0fe0729926b79267c3230de7b123655f5fb42e8d10fa64998f0d1ecf158a7e8"}
{"id": "ds:303:349:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]*Ahem* Here goes!", "sourceSha256": "5e2beb032c0b454d5bda8936ccf99b7157a213d837d0978a1ba686b4604caf83", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "962a9944d8e9f2356ab9dfe8ee7d7a481be8a488ddfd7c49a12003641e9520b6"}
{"id": "ds:303:350:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]Good Drink and Good Friends\nOn a lazy afternoon\nHow lucky am I", "sourceSha256": "5f330cc71c201bedb47ace971f114d57c1850c9071569e461a0f795324af9bd6", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "17e76bf971a89d5b098b158c8351ab3a3593b756fe5e2f5dca664cc4a1acfbaf"}
{"id": "ds:303:354:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]… Damn, Vi.", "sourceSha256": "bf79a4d4d165a8292dc861d79c5af149640089952d0eb8a3197823f9510dfe3e", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c664259612d68e2886a8354a0d566e503eb857f6f051220f25a30e8ee4d576c1"}
{"id": "ds:303:355:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=7]I’m not gonna lie - that haiku was a lot lamer until you explained it.", "sourceSha256": "ca724997a39687b1effc642c9c2d15632eaa86a2fccfb80576bbce0b547f3162", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "aa3ce0375a4d7fa382e34bf79635dc8a271ee6e2eba8c3614ea51860640ccc99"}
{"id": "ds:303:357:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Yeah, it may be a bit of a stretch, but that’s what I was thinking when writing.", "sourceSha256": "37f303f8f0dcedb23aa50b7d01ab858ccdd8104562d488c930139e20931666c7", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "179d6a9d55b56d182c94240bb7eb017e13cc8c0707f0381f94ebb96b69420fce"}
{"id": "ds:303:358:Dialogue Text", "source": "Damn, that was pretty deep!", "sourceSha256": "7ba3a4975632dbf1fe17e32e1b0e33588bc79bd2503e3ddf3ed7552b49729fa9", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "5ba213ef0249f7a6fb7cad4a5e7cbb0e8dc33975f859a10e7ef2b67855a0986c"}
{"id": "ds:303:360:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]We’re learning from the best after all!", "sourceSha256": "f87d43def4c1a018f09aaa6488dc6b6dd57fd3055185366d5dd49c66109f48da", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ab8cbefc37475f54fc72f970c97ef489f3c49356bdafdbe219158ea7b5477eb8"}
{"id": "ds:303:362:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Right? This idea really echos with the idea of time as a whole.", "sourceSha256": "7d07573faba2f956bc60f60dcb646e171f9a2e640c6d86682defe0d497d1c0d3", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "13be670a791cf06bec4e1dc194afe17b761227ed404ca693a4df4ba87010cb86"}
{"id": "ds:303:363:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Though we see time as a day to day thing, thousands of years ago, or thousands of years from now - so many things change, yet so much remains the same.", "sourceSha256": "8ef32124e54d4e4b9d9c4c487271a8212ed9002d5e6a3edfc5df7b2a689612bb", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "5ffde87772ce880433bec7d9da03b17486d7a88710939bf10e008d8591bdaa97"}
{"id": "ds:303:364:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]A journey without an end - yet time marches on, and flows like a river.", "sourceSha256": "5384c4afca96e24356fb32f5900525c197d38d0c9cc31549e2a7db9cf3856663", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "17e761bf9730a56aaf13de8b379295b93f3a1284dc7cd1e20c6c64212dd08dbc"}
{"id": "ds:303:365:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]It’s interesting to consider though, if \"time\" is the \"river,\" then we are the \"water.\"", "sourceSha256": "fc2cc1edf41b00379f17642b9a3775551f01ab0e45b3dbcbeff61561d5a59667", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "59fa664aad2c7ee4bbcc8fd2c7e088558f7aa03bf02ff4f83c154072ab7b9fa8"}
{"id": "ds:303:366:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]And does the \"water\" come back in the form of \"rain\" and \"snow\"?", "sourceSha256": "626ba02df2b581be9a0d500d2e7c4ab51816fe0ab89437735631e6d56dcac0e8", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2e08e22d0ce91bd9dd7099e375fe78fdf6554c020943d1c3cda6094dc99d1482"}
{"id": "ds:303:369:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]It’s not my greatest one. But I’ve captured a few concepts in this.", "sourceSha256": "173f43e8c7a263f3e8f415d121144f8ff0fb79f103213c83099830f6140d7d74", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "5ccf4b7918a90b861ab1945cdc77193b286827ac979bf52f50797ea4ed40d840"}
{"id": "ds:303:370:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]See Rascal, a difficult part of traditional haiku is the split of two ideas.", "sourceSha256": "cb9d4abe7226d6575e6f07dffb4bd00ae2325ba3844be652bdfac7893b56ff41", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "31e87c0b0fd85abb0fa59421ce66b589cde7be2a239643d226b8e1284e267213"}
{"id": "ds:303:371:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Two ideas that contrast each other, they vibrate against each other and change the context of each other.", "sourceSha256": "c7c528745bfe9235f43a372d1cf4b3f9b24858573ca133a7942b0ad654d0c3f0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2377cb69b368ceff8467dc28ae5710febf8abb4320ebca987378084acd0d0810"}
{"id": "ds:303:372:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]The poem is meant to capture both, the phenomena of an instant of observing water, yet the realization that every droplet of water is new.", "sourceSha256": "6485f55a9d2250d31fcec3b389223b4ad5040c271c44e0170694033aefd6d97c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c21de4b4f0159be31d94a2414adc9684c4d08ee09e61e10675604ca308b9b8d2"}
{"id": "ds:303:373:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]Each droplet that passes this place came from a glacier up above, and who knows, maybe it has made its way back here before.", "sourceSha256": "b75e05b74f7b9d0d657144a41f447aa802fb82ac46e9775d619c829f1b81d7a4", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a58dc0b1e4f244ca224c36e864a8eb9b8a2e539003b197d9cdc25759d6216c18"}
{"id": "ds:303:375:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Oh damn, that’s crazy. I’ve never considered the water flowing down this river is unique…", "sourceSha256": "359ce8fc71978ba4fecb4a123bb031dfc006ffdbf99636bfeae1996297c3c438", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "099958f4482585dfaa4814527e0d2d0406a9a5fed5daae016f9c9e149c1e1a4c"}
{"id": "ds:303:376:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Marching Forever\nA journey without an end\nThe flowing River", "sourceSha256": "4572e0d63f08d4a636d3da9e190870bf51724fbb1e1771038cfc1fe0f6e1e0b4", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "5698ce159039ac8429860f30309d06e1ea614ca2d46b3774941c10e3461cde9e"}
{"id": "ds:303:380:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]Bravo!", "sourceSha256": "165ccbcd8e2f120eed8db382b72c150c72ef5018bbcc159bcec63bfdcfbb34be", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c31032abdae5f88d3a2b0d456ae01cf6be887e215cfe9444c20ace79a9df7808"}
{"id": "ds:303:382:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Eh!", "sourceSha256": "74bf1471be13f89efe15ce92247c5a353aad1ed2bc340c63e59f89b84b997068", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "0f4ad6a90f919818f1ba27a3bb6a159992647a05d253713607f712b61c0eaace"}
{"id": "ds:303:383:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Most haiku reflect nature, a season, and one of the senses.", "sourceSha256": "89fc4a25cd0111a2ee1d31be05e4fcad449b011c3a1e5132b201b3babcaa39af", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ddda66b067584e36ebca7b50a0f6cd55f49c61daa02b68248c3e4c64c719a103"}
{"id": "ds:303:385:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]I’ll go first.", "sourceSha256": "9e1290d10e1bf4e977e61ee0a6e8a55fe818969889c18e498300c190cf42ca12", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a8dcb29f3ab1d399a7d594075495dc1a504dcbe0735c1141c62179732a7fe48c"}
{"id": "ds:303:386:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]But before I start. Rascal, do you remember last time when we were chilling?", "sourceSha256": "a338705317d254655de5d38b5bad8b47bfeef4999abf28a238ff37762a0d48d8", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "9c2e40b8c8775146757b568697c03e2da1bb700ee00a9c1886c4127d66ec82a6"}
{"id": "ds:303:387:Dialogue Text", "source": "Of course.", "sourceSha256": "404cba15a4acdcfea85caa97d009b1042d20f0967c26f9a1abf59aecbeddf9bd", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "84bb3590c63fe5ed0cab157c9a7b3d389064a63d0be16181b2ec610c37814c3b"}
{"id": "ds:303:389:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]This was composed during that chill session. You’ll see what I mean.", "sourceSha256": "f446fc1c4429d60e63e96da361313a0161bb3659b32c11fde252703beb8ae0f3", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "f417d32b725bc138c4bdacf0cab77085151e5eee7a103abc41411cfedbf0214b"}
{"id": "ds:303:390:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]Ahem!", "sourceSha256": "47b901532afd88b3d4c3e731c5e824c6da7163355e35d8112666061c5a4225c2", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a8fb74b223461b76fd3cb030fe22e23fe4efe4e44d8b763f5901a3f835318994"}
{"id": "ds:303:391:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Haiku are a type of poem.", "sourceSha256": "4939f698e808d5c0b6fa45226f9d6281535c5c9bffb0c2ddb6aa28bd52411cef", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "4221cfdc25870a8e5faafe376624f9c72cb115c5503645e90bf2b72f676e9935"}
{"id": "ds:303:392:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]They’re most recognized by their 5-7-5 syllable structure.", "sourceSha256": "0edcdf20fb488b1d895427e20bc138840e73f8157bde900d980da1066010dae1", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "140a891e8c1defc6567a5e4b478f06877e8ecf0a14ccb88898e18751c2bca4f7"}
{"id": "ds:303:393:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]But structure is only one piece of the puzzle.", "sourceSha256": "7407ec6f6d9c70d4e2a8bdced6a342461ae88d00943dc2e3b4f9a8f641fe7460", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "b99a16002387b812ea8a0dd3f25dccf9394823f0ba4351e99ad1f8c06e79c31a"}
{"id": "ds:303:394:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]A Haiku is a moment, an experience, if you will.", "sourceSha256": "a5c3b53cbd9f0c46d9bec4990de2cb5223b5559db75b413e2d7baa879a4ff4ca", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c5e4fd930544f82bc113bb4cc73e614c3a23cd6b920f3ba0e75e5b84ce44b1a0"}
{"id": "ds:303:396:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Today’s chill will also involve some creativity.", "sourceSha256": "ba4399869740b198945fd04e2d065b9dca868e6f1b4f8e62c68c7596fdafafaf", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "19f0b05a87bf46adf9ac112058c3c59752222abda43b52e7900dcb33c918264a"}
{"id": "ds:303:397:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]We’ll be diving into Haiku.", "sourceSha256": "cf77d8d46b8df4764c04d619d2b09e7a3cbbc571877dc39073952e8791f97b61", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "7e24314be100602a2daa32938e6dcaa1dda5f9b00ad28abeb19eab5825dc3c5d"}
{"id": "ds:303:398:Dialogue Text", "source": "Remind me what that is, exactly?", "sourceSha256": "fd9798d5ed5b533385fabf8d97a16bcfbd30cd6ce754dd9dbeedeec1d8ff8338", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "f9bba2ff8098caf65fb053b08af24ef6e81907d6b347c8064d4f685f43c8bdb7"}
{"id": "ds:303:400:Dialogue Text", "source": "Who’s going first?", "sourceSha256": "da4820a002e6fec34834bab0a9de5d55b5a5e34763293a23dbc7c673208e4ac0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "0b88396cec0cc4e6dd0f05999641bcd6431d3c0c2a3799c4ff0d7b4ecc9d1f49"}
{"id": "ds:303:401:Dialogue Text", "source": "That’s right! I’m here to chill.", "sourceSha256": "0ca8cb96eab07b2b4ad089bb34ecefebd2ebffa09097460a653cfd95959d588b", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "79206469278e694ce0f9b196018590f1f41bcfaab151a649ade51f23a06ecdba"}
{"id": "ds:303:402:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Hey! Looks like you’ve made it to another chill session!", "sourceSha256": "0cda0f4a27f32d2e615bea1bd644811c4d44aa06b48e7121f68a5eec401a0abf", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a3ada15cb61fe3b1876aea2e9b7cf60c458d04123c6fdb7662f0663f44d8fc73"}
{"id": "ds:303:406:Dialogue Text", "source": "Oh lovely Falcon", "sourceSha256": "83c5d22ed4ea07dfec7665439c25eac7dab06620231d5368ee095c3e8a4bbf4d", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "7f2758fb23b533937f7dda648ab9a07c3c752e4f1339d5621b1e548f9740b750"}
{"id": "ds:303:407:Dialogue Text", "source": "Take me high above the clouds", "sourceSha256": "c97f2da2724f8de67e702fc5655d2811854295a46373f8d0021d45482b138ff3", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2a3e9937d86138ebebca55cfe0eee0a2283a41e9241797c689f1157d90f805f2"}
{"id": "ds:303:408:Dialogue Text", "source": "Where no one has gone", "sourceSha256": "eda7b86bbf966e1d9c18727b5a13fd1963e98dd79aa642de355e51fd4e3d2156", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2e9b2fda97a5f567f535d8c426818d808f6ce4b8a485b2c09b96f7bfc5d01ebf"}
{"id": "ds:303:411:Dialogue Text", "source": "What is important to you?", "sourceSha256": "635346dbbc8d35268a00196326ac89299571c861217fd1402469c92c2da7a1bd", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "b5efd8c80018be6487d9f065b16cc93615757209c06121ac78841877503ba3df"}
{"id": "ds:303:412:Dialogue Text", "source": "Why must you work now?", "sourceSha256": "8d1eb87ec6a132ee29104614ad1730cb3e7cdb9274b611a70f8f2311756e6de2", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2212b1935f134103e6b3f31ac209ed70af13f0dee110bda71b6704f61bd0ea05"}
{"id": "ds:303:417:Dialogue Text", "source": "Keep it!", "sourceSha256": "051c7c15be2b7172702a809154f4e17f1c36a3720b9d3f38e03e0b1949015448", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a40f47c4df9cb7e70a607af2e11833f9693cf61e60a1bedc6984654fc196ff9e"}
{"id": "ds:303:418:Dialogue Text", "source": "Change it.", "sourceSha256": "2b20cecb2dfd69b480027ef2f40ac8741a99a52e8ea7b2628fd9b94cbedc4eb9", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "b16fe4fbd648cd2f1c9b2baa9713778f054595f991ee91b1294c1e4e329b3fbf"}
{"id": "ds:303:430:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]That was… actually pretty good. I’m impressed!", "sourceSha256": "f5d1d332b3ac00e3bb16812c984f1cf3b795c86d0baed932805d63f1837ccf8f", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "114b08f5e2569148d443ff7e4b769f5553553eb5f2dc42786686a6478cc0d311"}
{"id": "ds:303:431:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]I see you were inspired by Penny, she’d be happy to hear this!", "sourceSha256": "65ff13cfc316e241c561a39c4c1f588982aac62bd1615f20fcfc76cc2cb69e8c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a2dffac3806bf96c505db5da4f4eaf992fee7a6a1854814a8ce03fa9966eea39"}
{"id": "ds:303:433:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Absolutely, she’s a sap for this poetry stuff!", "sourceSha256": "b8d06674a6768ffdfd5407700f59aabaa003dc626fcbbc60baef4d991b435ea0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "1eda6a47efa071d7e4231cdc499e240d26d2ca3d4ff515a9d0805402bca152ca"}
{"id": "ds:303:435:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]I’m sure she’d love it!", "sourceSha256": "b6752c9e2c3f64f3257b00ac68bc7c846a723ad64d5f21acb4c07e1f797574bd", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "251a05f6a96e562c77e776e6ac4806da62b272727f983a4f572b12b499a76f95"}
{"id": "ds:303:438:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]That was… actually pretty good. I’m impressed!", "sourceSha256": "f5d1d332b3ac00e3bb16812c984f1cf3b795c86d0baed932805d63f1837ccf8f", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "98f345d1b679f9ce8a63df6d94433a22e579827a628128d59d643ca015a040e4"}
{"id": "ds:303:439:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]I dig the commentary! And good to see you’re an advocate of the chill life!", "sourceSha256": "a813cee9317ed59d00f7858e18a8ec2cdceba822c6c74bad8142ed80221a213a", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "d534f699b61d49c7b44ebf47eb481a8414002b57feaf5d3e4032d00310248d22"}
{"id": "ds:303:441:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]Yo, wait, are WE the bugs?? Damn.", "sourceSha256": "1fe3f1c7af0e366d82de840001cb12c904c443e482ad373dd42a040b236d96d9", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "381ece51c7a656ec575a16d012324d3a1e0b52a64f7efe89216b1e1b72434a0e"}
{"id": "ds:303:443:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Really makes ya think!", "sourceSha256": "a21130db9bcfa2dd920d06efbce34990da61baa95bb9bb447cdb6b3eb0385945", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "514bddb77660163709b360c728057a87999286fda3366c44db1c9e463b3adcb0"}
{"id": "ds:303:446:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]Ooh… umm. Hm!", "sourceSha256": "7d580faa4fee349cdd6f05b51b1bac1baa3aa4865b8f762c09e4bd28bdf839a4", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "dcdb56e5996a1f9f080cf88e8b31d00e378dd93eeee90ed916368974fd8b2fcf"}
{"id": "ds:303:447:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Quite… Avante garde! Yes!", "sourceSha256": "b0d7da4ede3a50ad0ce0154300385c6870b1a90f51d918d634cc73d5ce43def9", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "43457f04ff6ab054f647560c7a13d77402c5a7c680cbd8e252fbb7889dafc0fa"}
{"id": "ds:303:449:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Heh, that’s what she says to most of mine…", "sourceSha256": "c7809edf1a54ae2d59cb75957e145e41a21500bf8e715c94f5dd595e7ded9415", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2acf05754093b97f5595356c7210c49b87a85e57ef41108819c0db967b47e5be"}
{"id": "ds:303:450:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]It’s a good start Rascal!", "sourceSha256": "b126764cd99b350075c2c8be802bcea89876db14b5dcb854038b544a7c2a9af9", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "8dc61f658b40b7534d1203f227e3f3e3764988a329d95a3c8a83817022dd71ac"}
{"id": "ds:303:451:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]We can work shop it later!", "sourceSha256": "1b75d30a0bacd3032d6e3a2eac3c59907050059cf0140be2caaf2d4600494c7e", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "fa236b5a404489218cef62a868514cf1ae52147275f94d5c4a5063a2c925e624"}
{"id": "ds:303:453:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Not bad for a first try!", "sourceSha256": "3f6e377aaee7420acc84aaad3620f26ce07ee208c1f37c54f6bb7876d75adc15", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c6ee27a2fb9df99c172513d42851b7ea60c20ced48f0c17239246c8fa2014aef"}
{"id": "ds:303:455:Dialogue Text", "source": "Thanks guys!\nNext chill session, I’ll have something better!", "sourceSha256": "29b792c538202ba1e265c15d735eec6f08671cf09e06119f3e2d59546bf1c546", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "859d6249a8a6fd323758eb4303af8b9d9a891e6acc0a37e0e0d0d2832a23ce49"}
{"id": "ds:303:457:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Hell yeah, Blow our socks off!", "sourceSha256": "7dd27c686c03b1fe6246f1e0b68d497660aee540b5adef1948441c672f6d5220", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c54640af78fb3fd82ee82d71943ad32f7f917aac583b35543f0eec9e1ade5cd8"}
{"id": "ds:303:460:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]That was… actually pretty good. I’m impressed!", "sourceSha256": "f5d1d332b3ac00e3bb16812c984f1cf3b795c86d0baed932805d63f1837ccf8f", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "b2addafbfd5fff262f68863bbeb9dcf1a96c29922d97dc0d08aa7af65702cf41"}
{"id": "ds:303:461:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]I see you were inspired by the bridge and your experiences in the forest. Very nice!", "sourceSha256": "ad1d4b850b7f6552eaa57faee96db19f1521c6f147a2899d6ed5fd763ae1c04d", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "45cb1c298bc489d34d43d077c3431d9490c8e3d2c84f14fab6ffe2708520dd98"}
{"id": "ds:303:463:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Man, this guy’s a natural!", "sourceSha256": "b28dbfb09a97842e8ebc1a25bbd43c0741b2760f019a41ac69086122dd5d610a", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "2ea1a09c279f469797f0ad875666b91d7c02351e518ea019933a4c843fd33ec2"}
{"id": "ds:303:465:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]Yes wondorful job!", "sourceSha256": "d88b2657986bba8d3faeee759fdc91311623029f1152a3f90cc124316afaaf3b", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/candidate-context.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "df2e83c4de1238b4a6c21b10e122bbc81965dfdc983ada3bc517082a6805b644"}
